# @hub-lanes

# ── QA WIRING SWEEP (BH-6254, 2026-10-12) ────────────────────────────────────
# Daily at 05:55Z, five minutes after the doorbell check: is browser QA wired
# for every project in fleet.conf? bin/qa-wiring-check.sh checks the vercel.conf
# row, the prod URL, the QA account, the deploy kind and the Clerk prod origin.
# project-6-os merged 47+ PRs with none of them set: no preview QA, no prod QA,
# prod smoke off, and no line anywhere saying so. One ALERTS line and one
# fleet_alert per project per UTC day while any line is OWED. Read-only.
55 5 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/qa-wiring-sweep.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
